      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aquilla%2C_Texas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A 1897 well was dug after residents suffered illnesses from creek water, providing the town with fresh drinking water.",
